{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_027_23_5_02_027_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f9b49d62c00449e9195533a31ecddb852bf6ab688e85dff1b884ead31450467e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_23_5_02_027_23:5_02_027_23:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e48d8959041927135f4dc2c32d981572a45f255eeeab8f548c349f45cb85f74",
      "text": "今天谢谢你能过来，\n度过了一段开心的时光呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_23_5_02_027_23:5_02_027_23:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:034796d715653f53446de4f108a07c42854be8af690656f7153bb34a560e9386",
      "text": "最后把这个送给你。\n这是我送给你的白色情人节回礼哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_23_5_02_027_23:5_02_027_23:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:835a0694ef86cdf6790ebca03a1b89e035846b6af5e5d19305351ebea2309b14",
      "text": "非常感谢……！\n这是……餐具吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_23_5_02_027_23:5_02_027_23:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e7b9bdfca4bb0495bf4ae519f9842011aa1de0921a62ee004d36af9d3fffcdf",
      "text": "嗯，是西餐餐具套装哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_23_5_02_027_23:5_02_027_23:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203499e529399876267cf219cc198ac5c6d9075f9b9e0ce25f7572952343f08b",
      "text": "我想着能送一份为制作人的餐桌增添色彩的礼物，\n便选了这个呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_23_5_02_027_23:5_02_027_23:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f7309af4ef90c6d98926e0dee4ba6193ba60e1e53eef264fd60f76dce38f60a",
      "text": "想着如果能让平时总在为我们努力奔波的\n●●●●プロデューサー的用餐时光，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_23_5_02_027_23:5_02_027_23:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e99b4be070b3dc5ed8f0456b2164c98a8482c18124fff72538cfee7ecfb6566",
      "text": "哪怕增添一分富足与惬意就好了，于是做出了这样的选择。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_23_5_02_027_23:5_02_027_23:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dcab61072771c5f31a7150c68720e6f3584fdbbb252b61da4bbf8eb53f1c7ba",
      "text": "不嫌弃的话，希望能让它成为制作人生活的一部分呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_23_5_02_027_23:5_02_027_23:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d2e4001df33978cfbfc6be41f802bc613c2e6f0f09c3f5af9dc7ac033b6dbaa",
      "text": "真开心。\n我会好好珍惜使用的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_027_23_5_02_027_23:5_02_027_23:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5092833279f81e7094f4d11f56edd0ae28518bf853a849f501edee082d6391aa",
      "text": "你能喜欢真是太好了。\n今后也请多多关照了哦，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
